    "title": "Ongoing operations",
    "minutes": 10,
    "summary": "The maintenance rhythm after week 20.",
    "html": "<p>After Week 20 the effort shifts to a maintenance rhythm rather than ending:</p>\n<div class=\"tscroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Frequency</th><th>Activity</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Weekly</td><td>Team check-ins; claim log collection</td></tr><tr><td>Bi-weekly</td><td>Team Lead meeting</td></tr><tr><td>Monthly</td><td>Fact Sheet review and reissue if the record has changed; team health checks; budget review</td></tr><tr><td>Quarterly</td><td>Full materials audit against the Verification Log; refresher training; volunteer survey</td></tr><tr><td>As needed</td><td>Rapid response; new-volunteer onboarding</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>The Fact Sheet is a living document. Every reissue is dated and the prior version is retired.</p>"
