    "summary": "The five coordination roles, the meeting calendar, and communication norms.",
    "html": "<h2>Roles</h2>\n<p><b>Overall Coordinator</b> — oversees the effort, makes final calls, represents the group externally, obtains the records and legal guidance above. <i>Weekly:</i> review team reports, coordination meeting. <i>Monthly:</i> budget, progress, materials review, volunteer recognition.</p>\n<p><b>Record Director</b> — owns the Verification Standard, the Verification Log, all findings, and all published materials. Runs rapid response. Issues corrections. <i>Weekly:</i> new claims, document requests, verification queue. <i>Monthly:</i> Fact Sheet reissue, materials audit.</p>\n<p><b>Training Lead</b> — delivers initial and refresher training, develops materials, addresses skill gaps. <i>Weekly:</i> check in with new volunteers. <i>Monthly:</i> refresher session.</p>\n<p><b>Data Manager</b> — compiles claim logs, maintains the opt-in contact list, tracks metrics. <i>Weekly:</i> collect reports, update tallies. <i>Monthly:</i> report to coordination team.</p>\n<p><b>Resource Coordinator</b> — materials, expenses, logistics, meeting spaces. <i>Weekly:</i> expenses and supplies. <i>Monthly:</i> budget report.</p>\n<h2>Meetings</h2>\n<div class=\"tscroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Meeting</th><th>Frequency</th><th>Length</th><th>Attendees</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Team check-in</td><td>Weekly</td><td>15 min</td><td>Each team</td></tr><tr><td>Coordination team</td><td>Weekly</td><td>30 min</td><td>Five role holders</td></tr><tr><td>Team Lead meeting</td><td>Bi-weekly</td><td>45 min</td><td>All Team Leads + Coordinator</td></tr><tr><td>All-volunteer</td><td>Quarterly</td><td>90 min</td><td>Everyone</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2>Communication Norms</h2>\n<ul><li>Urgent: call or text</li><li>Routine: email</li><li>Response expectation: 24 hours</li><li>New claims: same day to Team Lead</li></ul>"
